# AGENTS.md — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

The working contract of this repository, loaded in every agent session (`CLAUDE.md` imports
it). It holds rules and reflexes only, and each rule names the check that enforces it; a rule
no check enforces says so. Rules proper to one part of the code live in `.claude/rules/`,
loaded when a matching file is read. Stories live in `docs/plans/`, decisions in `docs/adr/`,
measured traps in `docs/pitfalls/`. Sizes are capped by `scripts/agent-memory-check.mjs`.

